        },
        "description": "Dunn Smith looks to be a man in his thirties, with light brown hair, a straight nose, and sharp gray eyes. [Klein Moretti](https://anilist.co/character/192557/Moretti-Klein) described his eyes as \"like a lake in an ancient forest that no one visited, giving him an indescribable sense of depth\". He also has an receding Hairline despite his young Age.\n\nDunn Smith is the captain of the Nighthawks, a division under the Church of the Evernight Goddess, in Tingen City diocese.\n\nHe is a Sequence 7 Beyonder of the Darkness Pathway but has the power not too different from a Sequence 6.",
